	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=983,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040020"},
		line=983,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			hide=1,
			{
"They scatter...",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Fluttering from the sky.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			hide=1,
			{
"One petal of Persica, and another.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Alas, o beloved, tell me why.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Must you continue your fight, even unto your tears run dry?",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			hide=1,
			{
"I fain would ask you, to your humble servant impart,",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			hide=1,
			{
"The intricate layers of your most noble heart.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Hearken, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Mi-tsu-ru-gi!”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hmm? Ahh... what is it?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Some nerve my servant has, contemning his duties with idle daydreaming.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Mine apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Ah, that's right...",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I was occupied with mine duty of escorting Himi-no-Mikoto to the ritual hall.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Honestly. To think that this simpleton is the savior of the realm.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto runs a hand of slender fingers through her hair.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"The sunbeams set those sheer strands of gossamer ashimmer.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Though mine heart knows not of love, it comprehends well\nHimi-no-Mikoto's beauty.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Her amaranthine eyes shine with the lucidity of a consecrated wellspring, her lips as lustrous as a freshly bloomed Persica.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Her clarion voice is capable at once of stilling the hearts and quelling the spirits of all who stand before her.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"In the face of such a peerless elegance and aura of inviolable divinity, none can help but be overawed by her mere presence.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The Empire knows not of any nobler existence─",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Nor any more deserving personage to serve as its Founding Empress.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Mine existence was forged from thine hand. I daresay that any fault ought lie with the creator.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That's enough out of you.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I have no recollections of having made myself a jester.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto lightly pokes me on the nose with her fingertip.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hehee, 'tis no matter.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I shall attend now to the ritual of rainmaking. You may disport yourself for the time being.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Very well. That works out conveniently.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hmm? Have you matters to attend to?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Tooru has summoned me.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... Not again...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"A score of guardsmen hurriedly make their way down the high street in pursuit of a criminal.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Capital Watch! Halt at once!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“...Not like any self-respecting criminal'd actually listen though, eh, Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Right. If anything, he's running even faster.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Ah, blast it!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“That there's an infamous murderer! On the honor of the Capital Watch, don't you louts dare let him get away!”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Inou Tooru bellows out to his subordinates.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The Capital Watch─those responsible for keeping the peace in Tenkyo─are chasing after a criminal who has stirred up much trouble as of late.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"A notorious cut-throat who has taken the lives of no less than twenty-seven citizens.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Haah... haah...! I'm done... Can't keep up...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You ought to work out more.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“First thing tomorrow for sure!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Anyways, countin' on you, Mitsurugi!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"I rush ahead, leaving Tooru behind.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"The people of Tenkyo fear this criminal as a demon.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"There are whispers that he possesses inhuman strength capable of lifting boulders and fleetness of foot capable of outrunning a dire wolf.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Not so fast.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I catch a brief glimpse of the fleeing man.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"He bounds across the thatched rooftops like a feral monkey, easily evading the bewildered Capital Watch.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Even an acrobat would find it difficult to apprehend such a man.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I see now why mine presence was summoned.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hah!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Leaping into the sky─",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I draw mine blade─",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"And dive towards the criminal from above.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Prepare thyself.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"As a bird of prey, I bear down upon the condemned man, slashing out his legs.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Gwaaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"He somersaults through the air and tumbles off the edge of the roof.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Hyaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"─Could there be someone below?!",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I leap down to the street at once.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"A young damsel is lying collapsed to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"The man, furious and wounded, raises his blade above her.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"─He means to take her as a hostage!",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"I kick off the ground and interpose myself between them.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Kgh!”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The criminal's steel rives into me as I embrace the girl in mine arms.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Huh? Huuuhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Her eyes dart about in bewilderment at the situation.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Good, she's unharmed.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Still holding her in one arm, I turn around and fell the assailant with a sweep of mine blade.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Uwaaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"The sensation of flesh rending and bones shattering resonates through mine arm.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"The man is sent crashing through the clay wall at his back and falls still.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"It was only a strike with the dull edge of the blade, so he should still be amongst the living.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Are you unharmed?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Ah... Y-Yes! I have nary an injury!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"The young girl nervously straightens her back.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Her distinctive garb identifies her as a priestess.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I am glad to hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The Capital Watch will escort you home. They should arrive momentarily.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Yes, thank you very much!”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I turn around and move to check on the criminal's condition.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Hyaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"A second maidenly shriek stops me in mine tracks.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Ah...! Um, um, um, sire, th-that wound on your back!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Worry yourself not. It will be healed in due time.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I turn mine back on the girl once more.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Ah...! Um, um, um...!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“I-I do humbly beg your pardon, noble sire... but if it pleases you...”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hmm? I did not quite catch that.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“...M-Might you grace me with your name?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Ah, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I have not any formal name, but I am known by others as Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess"},
			{
"“Ahh, so my savior is the redeemer of the realm...”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Indeed. Now, if you'll bid me leave.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Awaken, knave.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I slap the cheeks of the criminal lying collapsed in the rubble.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“*Cough...!* *Cough, cough...*”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“How dare you slay so many innocents, vile criminal?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“How dare I? How dare I, he asks... Haha! Wahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Before I even knew it, thems was already corpses.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“If you really wants to know why, you can asks me dead body!”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Heheh, ahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...You slew them for naught but disport?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Oh, how tragic his victims are.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"There is at least some human sentiment in murder born of resentment or malice... but mere ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"caprice?",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Y've gots the smell of blood oozin' thick from yer own body, brother.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“No use tryna hide it. That scent of death... me nose knows it anywhere.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You speak true. I have indeed cut short more lives than I am capable of counting.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But all of it, I did in defense of the realm.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I silence him with a firm strike to the gut.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"The Capital Watch can be entrusted with his interrogation.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Some time after the manhunt, Tooru arrives at the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"This edifice is the residence of Empress Himi-no-Mikoto and the nexus of the Empire's governance.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"As one entrusted with safeguarding the Empress, these opulent halls are where I spend the most of mine days.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hail, Mitsurugi! You were here all along, eh?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What is it? Have you business with me?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I'm here to thank you for your help earlier, what else?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I need no gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“C'mon now, don't be like that.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“If you hadn't backed us up, that scoundrel would've gotten away.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“We can always count on you, Mitsurugi! They don't call you the savior of the realm for nothing!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"He claps me on the shoulder with a genial smile.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"This was by no means the first time I've been roped into assisting Tooru with apprehending a criminal.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Has judgment been passed on that criminal?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Course he'll be beheaded, and hopefully sooner than later.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“That chap is a lost cause. Seems like he can't help but get some sick pleasure outta murdering people.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“If he is to be beheaded anyway, I ought to have simply dispatched him yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"That priestess was placed into unnecessary danger only because I stayed mine hand.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“We gotta do things the proper way, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Only the Capital Watch is authorized to dispense justice on behalf of Himi-no-Mikoto-sama while she attends to more important matters.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“It's only proper that we first receive\nHimi-no-Mikoto-sama's assent, even if it's just to execute a common criminal.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But in actuality, you never do receive her assent.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“It's the pretext that matters, old chap.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Even if reality doesn't end up working out that way, it's important to keep up appearances.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“How confounding.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hahaha, that's the world of man for you.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Ultimately, it's important to deliver justice to criminals in\nHimi-no-Mikoto-sama's name.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“That's what makes the people feel like Himi-no-Mikoto-sama is watching over them, smiting down evildoers and safeguarding their homes.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I see. I shall reflect on what you've said.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Inou Tooru is a liegeman whose skill with the blade is nonexistent, but claims an intimate familiarity with the ways of “the world of man.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"As one unfamiliar with such matters, his stories always fascinate me.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Anyways, no need to sweat these small details.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“More importantly, first drink tonight's on me.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“A single drink does naught but whet one's thirst.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Ain't that the truth! S'pose I'll have to pack a few extra coins in my purse!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Tooru shows me an easygoing smile.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Come drop by the guardhouse once you're relieved of your duties.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I found myself a nice little tavern that just popped up. It'll knock your socks right off.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is that so? I look forward to it.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Tooru grins as he takes a large swig out of an imaginary cup.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"From his demeanor, none would suspect that this man could be the head of the venerable House Inou, one of the thirty-six noble houses that form the pillars of the Empire's governance.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Discussing matters of drink in broad daylight? It must be a most peaceful day in Tenkyo indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"A dignified voice resounds across the hall.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Tooru immediately drops one leg to the floor and lowers his head.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, 'tis a splendid day to be graced by your presence!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Well met.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Regrettably, my mood is far from splendid.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"All the surroundings immediately take on a newfound sense of serenity at her mere presence.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Inou, did I not last reprove your heedless summons of Mitsurugi to chase after common criminals?”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Her amaranthine eyes, abounding with wisdom, demand an answer from Tooru.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“My humblest apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto, I would say but one thing.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You may speak.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Those serene springs of amaranth turn in mine direction.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Mine duty is to defend the realm.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is assisting its guardsmen not one aspect of that duty?”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I see now that you interpreted it thus.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“In the first place, I have no defined purpose in times of peace.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I cannot imagine it fruitless to divert mine spare energies toward maintaining the capital's order.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I believe I already bestowed upon you a most paramount duty. Might my memory be failing me?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Did you, now?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Yours is to protect and amuse me!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Indeed, now I remember.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah... What a miserable fellow you are, feigning such brazen ignorance!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“None but you could dare speak to me in such a manner.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"I mimic the same posture as Tooru.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Granted life by Himi-no-Mikoto's magicks, mine existence is one wholly alien to the hierarchies of man.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Hence, Himi-no-Mikoto graciously abides mine most malapert conduct.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"If one such as Tooru were to behave in a similar manner toward his Empress, he would surely be executed on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oh, enough of this.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Attend me. We betake ourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“(Mitsurugi, I'll catch you later.)”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“(Yeah.)”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"I briefly meet Tooru's eyes as I rise to mine feet.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"We ascend a gentle slope and come to rest atop a verdant hillside overlooking all of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"This is Himi-no-Mikoto's favorite site of repose, one she visits often whenever her many labors afford her the opportunity.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I can no longer recall how many times I've now beheld this vista at her side.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“'Tis a lovely view.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto takes a deep breath as she stretches her hands towards the distant horizon.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The smoke of hearthfires fills the sky more and more with each passing day.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I can think of no greater proof that the people are living in prosperity.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Would that someday, Tenkyo might extend its reaches wide enough to cover this entire vast plain.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Four years have passed since the Great War.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Countless smaller realms have been united under the common banner of this Empire, and the long age of sanguinary conflict is behind us.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Even Tenkyo, once ravaged by the flames of war, is slowly being rebuilt in the image of peace.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This view is all owed to you, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“All thanks to you, strife has at last been banished from these lands.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I did nothing more than fulfill mine duty.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Will you ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"never",
{"/font"},
" cease to be such a simpleton?”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“At times like this, you need only to humbly accept your\nEmpress's acclaim.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto graces me with a helpless smile before once more returning her gaze to her beloved Tenkyo vista.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
